 "description": "Attribue un avantage (tickets restaurant, mutuelle, v\u00e9hicule, prime\u2026) \u00e0 une ressource.\n\nQuand : apr\u00e8s `boond_advantages_default` pour conna\u00eetre les types et montants de l'agence.\nPlut\u00f4t que : `boond_advantages_search` d'abord : l'API ne d\u00e9duplique pas.\n\n- Corps d\u00e9duit de `models.advantage` (`date`, `quantity`, `advantageType`, montants, relations `resource` / `contract` / `project` / `delivery`) \u2014 non \u00e9prouv\u00e9 sur un tenant de test.\n- \u00c9criture non idempotente.\n\nReturns : confirmation et ID de l'avantage (`structuredContent.id`).",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "icons": [
  {
   "src": "data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2016%2016'%20fill='%237d8794'%3E%3Cpath%20d='M2,4h12v8H2zm6,1.5A2.5,2.5,0,118,10.5a2.5,2.5,0,010-5z'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"
  }
 ],
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "advantageType": {
    "anyOf": [
     {
      "maximum": 9007199254740991,
      "minimum": -9007199254740991,
      "type": "integer"
     },
     {
      "minLength": 1,
      "type": "string"
     }
    ],
    "description": "Type d'avantage : `reference` ou `<reference>_<agencyId>` tel que publi\u00e9 par `boond_advantages_default` (`advantageTypes`)."
   },
   "agencyAmount": {
    "description": "Charges / coefficient de charge c\u00f4t\u00e9 agence.",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "contractId": {
    "description": "ID du contrat de rattachement.",
    "pattern": "^\\d+$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "date": {
    "description": "Date de l'avantage (YYYY-MM-DD).",
    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "deliveryId": {
    "description": "ID de la prestation.",
    "pattern": "^\\d+$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "employeeAmount": {
    "description": "Montant vers\u00e9 au salari\u00e9.",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "note": {
    "description": "Commentaires (`informationComments`).",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "participationAmount": {
    "description": "Participation salari\u00e9.",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "projectId": {
    "description": "ID du projet \u00e0 refacturer.",
    "pattern": "^\\d+$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "quantity": {
    "description": "Quantit\u00e9 (ex. nombre de tickets).",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "resourceId": {
    "description": "ID de la ressource b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiaire (relation `resource`, requise).",
    "pattern": "^\\d+$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "returnDate": {
    "description": "Date de restitution (v\u00e9hicule, mat\u00e9riel).",
    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "resourceId",
   "advantageType",
   "date"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "boond_advantages_create",
 "outputSchema": {
